        "objective": "Summarize only supplied evidence without commands. Deferred candidates are expected: status=deferred.decision, pr_url=\"\", incomplete=\"\". Existing PR links belong in evidence, not pr_url. If published exists use its status/pr_url/limitations, and include the validation child run ID. If validation_failed, validation_crashed or validation_cancelled exists, status=blocked, pr_url=\"\", incomplete names the child run and failed validation; no publication is authorized. If result.status=patch_prepared but no published result exists, explicitly say validation/publication did not complete, never call it fixed. Otherwise use result status/limitations and leave pr_url empty. If eligible exists but result missing, status=incomplete and explain patch preparation failed/timed out. The paired eligible/deferred branch that was not chosen is not a missing result. Preserve actual reproduction and test limitations. This is a continuation of an already-prepared patch from source_run_id. There is no preparation result input in this plan; its absence is expected. Include the source run ID in evidence. Report validation failures or missing publication accurately."
      }
